  "script": "(* Grundfos status word 00201: bit 6 rotation, bit 8 remote access, bit 10 alarm *)\nRunning := ((Status - (Status MOD 64)) / 64) MOD 2;\nRemote := ((Status - (Status MOD 256)) / 256) MOD 2;\nAlarm := ((Status - (Status MOD 1024)) / 1024) MOD 2;\n(* 0.01 K, read as absolute kelvin (Grundfos does not state an offset) *)\nLiquid_C := Liquid_K - 273.15;\n",
